        'shoulder.R'\n\tTransform 'upper_arm.L'\n\tand more ...\n\tFrom animation
        clip 'CS6_Frame1_Bet holds lantern'\n\tFrom animation clip 'CS6_Frame2_Bet
        searching with lantern'\n\tFrom animation clip 'CS6_Frame4_Hands finds Ghost'\n\tFrom
        animation clip 'CS6_Frame5_Bet trying to escape'\n\tFrom animation clip 'Frame5_CS5_Bet
        head turn right'\n\tFrom animation clip 'Frame6_CS5_Bet head turn left'\n\tFrom
